# J_geo from the robot to each frontier cluster F_i of the latest graph snapshot, as the paper's
# ATSP takes it: min over the cluster voxels C_i (they lie on M_trav, so they are graph nodes) of
# the path cost on the support graph, and v_target, the voxel where it is reached
# (voxel_mapper_node, trav3d.SupportGraph).
geometry_msgs/Point source
---
int64[] ids                     # frontier cluster ids (frontier3d, as in voxel_map/frontier_clusters)
float64[] costs                 # inf: no voxel of the cluster reachable from the source
geometry_msgs/Point[] targets   # v_target per cluster (its centroid when unreachable)
bool ok                         # false: no map / graph yet
